        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1)(k) PILOT EMPLOYEE HOSPITAL BILL AUDIT AWARD – Employees enrolled in the Traditional Medical Plan are eligible to share in savings by the Company when they identify and correct an error in hospital billing. The award is 50% of the savings to a maximum of $500. The determination of award is final and not subject to the grievance procedure. This is a pilot program and may be discontinued at any time, at the sole discretion of the Company.",
