        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1)(I) DEPENDENTS – Employees may enroll dependents in the Traditional Plan based on eligibility as defined in the Plan document. Sponsored dependents, as defined in the Plan document, may be enrolled in the all Company sponsored health care plans that allow Sponsored Dependents, for the full cost, and, effective January 1, 2001, are eligible for all benefits as outlined in the Plan document, including prescription drugs and applicable preventive care. Effective January 1, 2001, Sponsored Dependents will be limited to the parents and child(ren) of the employee. Effective January 1, 2001, active employees may enroll, as dependents, Same Sex Partners who meet the eligibility requirements of the Plan document. Retirees can only cover the Same Sex Partners that they covered as an active",
